    "text": "pragma silverscript ^0.1.0;\n\n// Decentralized P2P Auction governed by Kaspa Covenants:\n// - The seller initiates the auction with an initial reserve price.\n// - The winning bidder can claim and settle the lot.\n// - The seller collects the highest bid funds upon closure.\n// - If reserve is not met, the seller can cancel and reclaim the deposit.\ncontract KaspaAuction(pubkey seller, pubkey highestBidder, int minBidSompi) {\n  // Seller finalizes auction and claims the winning bid\n  entry close(sig sellerSig) {\n    require(checkSig(sellerSig, seller));\n  }\n\n  // Highest bidder settles and receives the auctioned covenant asset\n  entry claim(sig winnerSig) {\n    require(checkSig(winnerSig, highestBidder));\n  }\n\n  // Seller cancels auction and reclaims deposit\n  entry cancel(sig sellerSig) {\n    require(checkSig(sellerSig, seller));\n  }\n}\n"
  },
